Radio stack — NOT bundled; you install it yourself
--------------------------------------------------
This repository does not distribute the Meshtastic radio stack. The supervisor
depends on, and the user separately installs:
- meshtasticd (GPL-3.0) — https://github.com/meshtastic/firmware
- the meshtastic Python client library (GPL-3.0) — https://github.com/meshtastic/python
Because these are installed by the user and run as separate programs, this
repository distributes no GPL binaries; the supervisor and its guardian/firewall helpers are GPL-3.0-or-later.
See supervisor/LICENSE.GPL for the full license.

